   "id": "c3edf8cc-566e-7f03-7bc6-d6bbda02a93b",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"text-block-75\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"d87afbab-8d53-00ba-ca99-a5626459b694\">Clean, natural energy</strong> – Packed with antioxidants and L-theanine<br data-w-id=\"3ce0e77a-e988-5a01-d20a-0140f0fdb9cb\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"eb246f26-5d6f-6075-8e3b-f7490b98fe94\">Health-forward</strong> – Vegan, organic, and aligned with wellness goals<br data-w-id=\"dce1c3d5-4001-f930-2599-029215877d6b\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"c1b37cad-66d3-bdad-7a9c-6a6c72165ee7\">Versatile &amp; profitable</strong> – Great for shakes, bowls, teas, and elixirs<br data-w-id=\"3fd1eec8-9f0a-b38a-25de-e9eac0689651\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"b3ab7821-32b2-d14a-b57c-33502925a7d1\">Loved by your audience</strong> – Ideal for health-conscious consumers</div>",
    "text": "✔️ Clean, natural energy – Packed with antioxidants and L-theanine\n✔️ Health-forward – Vegan, organic, and aligned with wellness goals\n✔️ Versatile & profitable – Great for shakes, bowls, teas, and elixirs\n✔️ Loved by your audience – Ideal for health-conscious consumers"
   },
