   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"text-block-75-2\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"959cc02c-c143-4f11-c1b1-4bc810c7e389\">Trusted by wellness professionals</strong> – Reliable supply and premium quality<br data-w-id=\"761342d5-2188-129e-7df0-56a9edc488a9\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"a48e5063-5847-4086-a12a-0f81ed94a91d\">Ethically sourced</strong> – Direct from small farms in Japan<br data-w-id=\"8782d1e2-22fc-edf1-4dd5-eed5e2743d88\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"b1301c8a-5a5c-89f3-6b29-224659efd15b\">Flexible formats</strong> – Available for lattes, smoothies, and more<br data-w-id=\"9db76c09-0f9a-8662-85b1-a3dfc21c2ecc\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"b22de3ed-927f-49b1-e7e4-b8d57f6eccc3\">Supports your brand values</strong> – Clean, sustainable, and authentic</div>",
    "text": "✔️ Trusted by wellness professionals – Reliable supply and premium quality\n✔️ Ethically sourced – Direct from small farms in Japan\n✔️ Flexible formats – Available for lattes, smoothies, and more\n✔️ Supports your brand values – Clean, sustainable, and authentic"
